    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to LightQb</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>forced</strong> to take part in a twisted game <strong>you didn't sign up for</strong>. Trapped in an unknown space, you must dash and <strong>survive</strong> through a monochrome, grid-like world filled with colored <strong>cubes</strong>, each with unique mechanics.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/2a827030be6a4b7b373eac2036282997.poster.avif?t=1739299444\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/2a827030be6a4b7b373eac2036282997.webm?t=1739299444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/2a827030be6a4b7b373eac2036282997.mp4?t=1739299444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play, die and repeat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>cycle</strong> continues until you master your path to the end or give up. Oh, and did I mention there\u2019s someone mocking you every time you <strong>die</strong>? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/8f6e49442bbd6745fece44e8a10223e5.poster.avif?t=1739299444\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/8f6e49442bbd6745fece44e8a10223e5.webm?t=1739299444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/8f6e49442bbd6745fece44e8a10223e5.mp4?t=1739299444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time is your greatest enemy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cubes, lasers, and portals to your advantage as you blaze through levels at incredible speeds, but <strong>beware</strong>, there might be more to this world than meets <strong>the eye</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/9db623cb0c7cf9ccccbce48746302645.poster.avif?t=1739299444\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/9db623cb0c7cf9ccccbce48746302645.webm?t=1739299444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/9db623cb0c7cf9ccccbce48746302645.mp4?t=1739299444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Powerful foes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, every few levels you are presented with a seemingly impossible challenge, <strong>a boss</strong> if you will, each with unique mechanics and clear conditions.\u00a0</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Welcome to LightQb</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>forced</strong> to take part in a twisted game <strong>you didn't sign up for</strong>. Trapped in an unknown space, you must dash and <strong>survive</strong> through a monochrome, grid-like world filled with colored <strong>cubes</strong>, each with unique mechanics.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/2a827030be6a4b7b373eac2036282997.poster.avif?t=1739299444\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/2a827030be6a4b7b373eac2036282997.webm?t=1739299444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/2a827030be6a4b7b373eac2036282997.mp4?t=1739299444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play, die and repeat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>cycle</strong> continues until you master your path to the end or give up. Oh, and did I mention there\u2019s someone mocking you every time you <strong>die</strong>? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/8f6e49442bbd6745fece44e8a10223e5.poster.avif?t=1739299444\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/8f6e49442bbd6745fece44e8a10223e5.webm?t=1739299444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/8f6e49442bbd6745fece44e8a10223e5.mp4?t=1739299444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Time is your greatest enemy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cubes, lasers, and portals to your advantage as you blaze through levels at incredible speeds, but <strong>beware</strong>, there might be more to this world than meets <strong>the eye</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/9db623cb0c7cf9ccccbce48746302645.poster.avif?t=1739299444\" width=800 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/9db623cb0c7cf9ccccbce48746302645.webm?t=1739299444\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3392840/extras/9db623cb0c7cf9ccccbce48746302645.mp4?t=1739299444\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Powerful foes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, every few levels you are presented with a seemingly impossible challenge, <strong>a boss</strong> if you will, each with unique mechanics and clear conditions.\u00a0</p>",
